# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit real keys.
# On Vercel: set each as a sensitive env var (production + preview).

# PRINTFUL_API_KEY — server-side only. lib/store-printful.js reads the live
# catalog ("Omega Store", store id 17419146) with it; it must never reach the
# client bundle, never be logged, never be printed.
# Create it in the Printful dashboard: Settings -> API (developers.printful.com)
# -> create a new private API token.
# Scopes: catalog READS work today (GET /store/products, list-only store).
# Order submission (POST /orders, fulfillment) needs a token with order-write
# scope — confirm the scope before ever wiring checkout.
PRINTFUL_API_KEY=
